{"id":"5f1a82cfa5790c35","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-measurement.md","title":"Quantum Measurement","display":"df-measurement — Quantum Measurement","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-measurement","aliases":["28-df-measurement","Quantum Measurement","POVM"],"display":"df-measurement — Quantum Measurement","depends_on":["[[28-df-quantum-state]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.3.2; density-operator Born-rule extension","source_printed_pages":"210,214","source_pdf_pages":"236,240","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-measurement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-measurement</span><span>Quantum Measurement</span><span>POVM</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-measurement — Quantum Measurement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b69949a89b41b967\" href=\"?note=b69949a89b41b967\" title=\"28-df-quantum-state\">28-df-quantum-state</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.3.2; density-operator Born-rule extension"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"210,214"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"236,240"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_n)\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_n)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 为有限非空结果集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E:\\Omega\\to\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n)\">\\(E:\\Omega\\to\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>正算子记号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b69949a89b41b967\" href=\"?note=b69949a89b41b967\" title=\"28-df-quantum-state\">28-df-quantum-state</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{E,\\rho}\">\\(\\mu_{E,\\rho}\\)</span> 为下式定义的有限概率质量函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{POVM}(E)\\leftrightarrow(\\forall a\\in\\Omega\\ E_a\\succeq0)\\land\\sum_{a\\in\\Omega}E_a=I_{2^n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{POVM}(E)\\leftrightarrow(\\forall a\\in\\Omega\\ E_a\\succeq0)\\land\\sum_{a\\in\\Omega}E_a=I_{2^n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{E,\\rho}(a)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Tr}(E_a\\rho)\\qquad(\\operatorname{POVM}(E),\\ a\\in\\Omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_{E,\\rho}(a)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Tr}(E_a\\rho)\\qquad(\\operatorname{POVM}(E),\\ a\\in\\Omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_{\\mathsf{acc},n}\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:x_1=1}|x\\rangle\\langle x|\\quad(n\\ge1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_{\\mathsf{acc},n}\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:x_1=1}|x\\rangle\\langle x|\\quad(n\\ge1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>对 POVM 与密度算子，迹规则非负且总和为一，所以确实给出概率分布。它只定义结果概率；没有由 POVM 单独决定测后状态，因而不假造这样的状态函数。书的计算基测量是其特例；一般 POVM 是本地扩展。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§10.3.2; density-operator Born-rule extension，印刷页 210,214；PDF 页 236,240。原书未定位到本条的完整直接陈述；这是与书中主题相关的本地补充。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-quantum-state","status":"resolved","id":"b69949a89b41b967","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-quantum-state]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-quantum-state","status":"resolved","id":"b69949a89b41b967","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"正算子记号见 [[28-df-quantum-state]]；$\\mu_{E,\\rho}$ 为下式定义的有限概率质量函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"E:\\Omega\\to\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_{E,\\rho}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{POVM}(E)\\leftrightarrow(\\forall a\\in\\Omega\\ E_a\\succeq0)\\land\\sum_{a\\in\\Omega}E_a=I_{2^n}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu_{E,\\rho}(a)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Tr}(E_a\\rho)\\qquad(\\operatorname{POVM}(E),\\ a\\in\\Omega).","display":true},{"tex":"E_{\\mathsf{acc},n}\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:x_1=1}|x\\rangle\\langle x|\\quad(n\\ge1).","display":true}],"bytes":1661,"backlinks":[{"id":"c0486b96e648a9d6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$、$\\operatorname{QU}$、$\\operatorname{Out}$、$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-circuit]]；$E_{\\mathsf{acc},m}$ 见 [[28-df-measurement]]。"},{"id":"c994a65ad9a02350","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$、$\\operatorname{QU}$、$\\operatorname{Out}$、$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-circuit]]；密度算子与接受投影见 [[28-df-quantum-state]]、[[28-df-measurement]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"状态空间：[[28-df-qubit]]、[[28-df-quantum-state]]、[[28-df-measurement]]。"}],"outgoing":["b69949a89b41b967"]}